      "path": "eslint.config.js",
      "content": "This overrides `noIdentityRules`'s `no-restricted-syntax` configuration for non-test UI files: ESLint replaces a rule's options rather than concatenating its selectors. Consequently, `navigator.userAgent` (and the other prohibited identity accesses) now passes `npm run lint` in those files. Combine the identity and wording selectors for overlapping files, or use separate rule IDs so both restrictions remain enforced.",
